OL,3,GNEWSAPoker player becomes first female
OL,4,Awinner on UK tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA poker player has become the first
OL,7,Fwoman to win a major event on a UK
OL,8,Ftour.
OL,10,FRenee Xie, from Northamptonshire, won
OL,11,Fthe Grosvenor UK Poker Tour (GUKPT)
OL,12,FLuton Main Event on 6 September,
OL,13,Fbeating 396 other entrants.
OL,15,FThe GUKPT is a poker series which hosts
OL,16,Fevents across the UK and Xie is the
OL,17,Ffirst woman to win one of its main
OL,18,Fevents in its 20-year history.
OL,20,FShe told Annabel Amos on BBC Radio
OL,21,FNorthampton: "I couldn't believe I won.
OL,22,FI was at a loss for words."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
